              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugore we aramubwira ati “Iyaba Uwiteka yashatse kutwica, ntaba yemeye igitambo cyacu cyoswa cyangwa icy'amafu y'impeke, ntaba yatweretse ibyo byose kandi ntaba yatubwiye nk'ibyo muri iki gihe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
